3529	/**
3530	 * Resolve a program name/path to an absolute executable ON THE TARGET, or "".
3531	 * Used to rewrite a captured ExecStart's interpreter to a path that exists here
3532	 * (the source may have run `/usr/local/bin/node`; the target has `/usr/bin/node`).
